    <name>InstaZDLL</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Zig Roulette is a native GTK4/libadwaita casino game built with Zig.
      It provides a European roulette table with clickable betting areas,
      animated spins, local session credits, and unit-tested payout rules.
      The interface includes quick max-bet controls, undo for the last active
      bet, a full new-session reset, structured active-bet rows, and
      color-coded result history.
    </p>
  </description>
